+- Direction mapping: 0=+X, 1=-X, 2=+Y, 3=-Y, 4=+Z, 5=-Z [S1, unofficial].
+- Lighting values per direction: $[1, 1, 3, 0, 2, 2]$ [S1, unofficial].
+- Texture coordinate mapping per direction: $[2, 3, 0, 0, 3, 2]$ [S1, unofficial].
